# BUGS

Only playback is lent; capture is read through `data` alone.
`data` takes no ring (node(5)): its frames are copied by message, once, between the client and the buffer.
A blocked read of `data` and a write from another client wait for each other.
No driver has amplifiers yet, so `volume` has no levels.
